<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!--
    Realistic handling for Close Air Support's jets: the setting "Realistic handling" on D'thorga Patches' Close Air Support page, off by
    default (owner's choice, 21 Nov 2026: "correct, as a setting"; docs/development/close-air-support-jets.md). It takes effect at the next
    start, as every setting that changes Defs does. Off, the author's figures stand.

    Speeds are put on the Harrier's scale, its author's top speed of 0.30 standing for the AV-8B's 1,083 km/h at sea level (secondary:
    Wikipedia), each jet scaled by its own real figures (agent's derivation, authored):
    - A-10: top speed 706 km/h (secondary: Wikipedia, A-10C) gives 0.196, so 0.20 (the author's 0.27). Cruise 560 km/h (secondary: the
      same) gives 0.155; the fixed-wing framework flies attack runs at the jet's orbit speed, 0.16 here, and a cruise below that would make
      it attack faster than it travels, so the cruise is raised to 0.16 (the author's 0.21).
    - Su-25: top speed 950 km/h (secondary: Russian Wikipedia; Airforce Technology) gives 0.263, so 0.26 (the author's 0.30, the
      Harrier's own). Cruise 750 km/h (secondary: Russian Wikipedia) gives 0.208, so 0.21 (the author's 0.24), still above its 0.18
      orbit.
    - A-10 on one engine: 0.80 of its speeds, the fixed-wing framework's own default and what the author gives the Su-25 (the author's
      0.95 for the A-10). No published speed on one engine was found; the A-10A flight manual's worked example climbs only about 200 ft a
      minute on one engine at 40,000 lb with the gear down (primary: T.O. 1A-10A-1, appendix A2), which 0.95 does not suggest.
    Take-off and landing figures, orbit and attack-run speeds and turning are left as the author set them, since the bomb release and
    strafe timing are worked out from them.
  -->
  <Operation Class="Phobos.Framework.Patching.PatchOperationPhobosFlag">
    <flag>PhobosCloseAirSupportPatches.realisticHandling</flag>
    <operations>
      <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
        <xpath>Defs/Vehicles.VehicleDef[defName="Warthog_Jet"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="CloseAirSupport.Flight.FixedWingProperties"]/maxSpeed</xpath>
        <value>
          <maxSpeed>0.20</maxSpeed>
        </value>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
        <xpath>Defs/Vehicles.VehicleDef[defName="Warthog_Jet"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="CloseAirSupport.Flight.FixedWingProperties"]/cruiseSpeed</xpath>
        <value>
          <cruiseSpeed>0.16</cruiseSpeed>
        </value>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
        <xpath>Defs/Vehicles.VehicleDef[defName="Warthog_Jet"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="A10Warthog.WarthogExtension"]/oneEngineSpeedFactor</xpath>
        <value>
          <oneEngineSpeedFactor>0.80</oneEngineSpeedFactor>
        </value>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
        <xpath>Defs/Vehicles.VehicleDef[defName="Frogfoot_Jet"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="CloseAirSupport.Flight.FixedWingProperties"]/maxSpeed</xpath>
        <value>
          <maxSpeed>0.26</maxSpeed>
        </value>
      </li>
      <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
        <xpath>Defs/Vehicles.VehicleDef[defName="Frogfoot_Jet"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="CloseAirSupport.Flight.FixedWingProperties"]/cruiseSpeed</xpath>
        <value>
          <cruiseSpeed>0.21</cruiseSpeed>
        </value>
      </li>
    </operations>
  </Operation>
</Patch>
